# CHANGELOG

## [0.1.0] - 2025-10-03
### Added
- Initial release of the `web_apache` role.
- Installs and manages `apache2` service (state + enablement).
- Declarative VirtualHosts via `web_apache_vhosts` with per-site `docroot`, optional `index.php`, and log paths.
- Jinja2 vhost template (`templates/vhost.conf.j2`) with override per vhost via `template` var.
- Enabling/disabling sites using `a2ensite`/`a2dissite` with idempotent guards (`creates`/`removes`).
- Optional management of default sites:
  - `000-default.conf` (restore from template if missing, enable/disable switches).
  - `default-ssl.conf` (auto-enables `mod_ssl` when requested).
- Optional catch-all site (`000-catch-all.conf`) with modes `403`, `404`, or `redirect`.
- Optional purge of unmanaged vhosts (safe excludes) and optional docroot deletion under allowed prefixes.
- Handlers for `configtest` + graceful reload on changes.
- Check-mode support where possible; safe, idempotent tasks with clear tags.
- Molecule scenario (Ubuntu Jammy) validating package install, port 80 listening, and a vhost answering.
